#15300
The desolate road~
You are on a dirt road that leads up the mountainside.  The area is completely
bleak.  The ground is bumpy, the trees are leafless, and there is a feeling of
great evil emanating from the top of the mountain.  A newly built stone wall
of enormous statue with a gate of steel reinforced oak, blocks the path leading
to the north.  The gate looks strong enough to keep anyone out ... or is it to 
keep something in?
~
